1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,254
People screenshot tickets. Hosts can't tell who actually holds the pass.

2
00:00:04,454 --> 00:00:18,106
The host mints an NEP-171 ticket to the guest's account.

3
00:00:18,356 --> 00:00:23,941
The contract is the source of truth. The guest owns this ticket.

4
00:00:24,191 --> 00:00:40,872
The guest transfers it to a buyer. Provenance stays on chain.

5
00:00:41,122 --> 00:00:49,733
At the door, the buyer is admitted.

6
00:00:49,983 --> 00:00:58,383
The previous owner is denied.

7
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:04,687
Ownership, trading, and provenance on NEAR. Built at NEAR HACKATHON.

